OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated in ongoing police
OL,4,Aoperation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of homes have been evacuated
OL,7,Fand a policing operation is ongoing in
OL,8,Fwest Belfast.
OL,10,FDetectives are conducting searches of
OL,11,Ftwo properties on the Shankill Road as
OL,12,Fpart of an investigation into suspected
OL,13,Fterrorism offences.
OL,15,FA 35-year-old man was arrested for
OL,16,Foffences under the Terrorism Act, and
OL,17,Fremains in police custody at this time.
OL,19,FA number of items have been located at
OL,20,Fan address at Edwina Street and it is
OL,21,Funderstood a device has been recovered.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
